              "title": "Asking and Giving Directions",
              "weight": 1,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009201000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aA1bB2cC3d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"When you are in a city, you sometimes need to ask <b>for directions</b>. Here is how:\"}},{\"id\":\"dD4eE5fF6g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Asking:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"gG7hH8iI9j\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Excuse me, how do I get to the train station?</b>\",\"<b>Could you tell me the way to the city centre?</b>\",\"<b>Is the bank far from here?</b>\",\"<b>Where is the nearest supermarket?</b>\"]}},{\"id\":\"jJ0kK1lL2m\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Giving directions:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"mM3nN4oO5p\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Go straight on.</b> — Идите прямо.\",\"<b>Turn left / right.</b> — Повернитe налево / направо.\",\"<b>Take the first / second turning.</b> — Поверните на первом / втором повороте.\",\"<b>Go past the traffic lights.</b> — Пройдите мимо светофора.\",\"<b>It's on the left / right.</b> — Это слева / справа.\",\"<b>It's opposite the park.</b> — Это напротив парка.\",\"<b>It's about five minutes' walk.</b> — Это примерно пять минут ходьбы.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "Excuse me, how do I get to the train station? Go straight on, then turn left at the traffic lights. It's about five minutes.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "phrases",
                  "phrases": [
                    {
                      "text": "Excuse me, where is the nearest bank?",
                      "translation": "Извините, где ближайший банк?"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Go straight on.",
                      "translation": "Идите прямо."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Turn left at the traffic lights.",
                      "translation": "Поверните налево у светофора."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "It's on the right.",
                      "translation": "Это справа."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "It's about five minutes' walk.",
                      "translation": "Это примерно пять минут ходьбы."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "order": 4,
                  "type": "matching",
                  "pairs": [
