            {
              "title": "Buying a Ticket",
              "weight": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009203000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"vV2wW3xX4y\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Travelling by <b>public transport</b> — useful vocabulary and phrases:\"}},{\"id\":\"yY5zZ6aA7b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Types of transport:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"bB8cC9dD0e\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>bus</b> — автобус\",\"<b>underground / tube / metro</b> — метро\",\"<b>train</b> — поезд\",\"<b>tram</b> — трамвай\",\"<b>taxi / cab</b> — такси\"]}},{\"id\":\"eE1fF2gG3h\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>At the ticket office:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"hH4iI5jJ6k\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>A single to London, please.</b> — Один билет в одну сторону до Лондона.\",\"<b>A return to Manchester.</b> — Билет туда-обратно до Манчестера.\",\"<b>Which platform is it?</b> — На каком перроне?\",\"<b>When is the next train to Oxford?</b> — Когда следующий поезд до Оксфорда?\",\"<b>How much is a day pass?</b> — Сколько стоит проездной на день?\"]}},{\"id\":\"kK7lL8mM9n\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Useful words:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"nN0oO1pP2q\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>platform</b> — перрон\",\"<b>departure</b> — отправление\",\"<b>arrival</b> — прибытие\",\"<b>delay</b> — задержка\",\"<b>timetable</b> — расписание\",\"<b>fare</b> — стоимость проезда\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "A single to London, please. How much is that? Eight pounds fifty. Which platform? Platform three.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "phrases",
                  "phrases": [
                    {
