        {
          "title": "Describing Items and Comparing",
          "weight": 6,
          "content": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700009206000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yY6zZ7aA8b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"When shopping, we often <b>compare</b> items using comparatives and superlatives:\"}},{\"id\":\"bB9cC0dD1e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Comparatives (сравнение двух):</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"eE2fF3gG4h\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"This jacket is <b>cheaper</b> than that one.\",\"The red one is <b>more expensive</b>.\",\"This bag is <b>bigger</b> and <b>heavier</b>.\",\"That coat is <b>better quality</b>.\"]}},{\"id\":\"hH5iI6jJ7k\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Superlatives (превосходная степень):</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"kK8lL9mM0n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"This is the <b>cheapest</b> option.\",\"That is the <b>most expensive</b> item.\",\"It's the <b>best</b> choice for the price.\"]}},{\"id\":\"nN1oO2pP3q\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<em>Rule: short adjectives → add <b>-er / -est</b>. Long adjectives → use <b>more / most</b>.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "type": "audio",
              "content": {
                "text": "This jacket is cheaper than that one. That coat is more expensive but better quality. This is the cheapest option.",
                "type": "tts",
                "audio_url": ""
              }
            },
